lines:
爸爸告诉我，这隧道
里全是胆小的宝可梦
。{be01}
它们听到巨响就会受
惊，引发大骚乱。{be01}
所以大型隧道工程被
迫中止了。{be01}
但有个男人还在独自
挖掘！

Did you see the cave next to the
Pokémon Mart?{be01}
There’s a guy in there who’s trying to
bust up boulders so he can bust out{be00}
through to the other side.{be01}
It’d be great if we could go through...
It’ll make it easy to visit Rustboro.
